From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 11:42:34 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gateway): standby gateway waits for the profile lock

gateway.runtime_lock_wait_seconds (0 = off): a gateway that finds its
profile owned warms up, then waits for the owner to exit and takes over
instead of exiting 1. Lock records carry the PID namespace, so a holder
in a sibling container is not read as stale.
